{"id":214050,"ne":"Phantom of the Banquet","r":5,"tg":["Elemento","Habilidades","Definitiva"],"mel":{"n":"Phantom of the Banquet","ne":"Phantom of the Banquet","ic":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/AutumnVN/ssassets/main/export/assets/assetbundles/icon/discskill/DiscSkill_214050.webp","bg":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/AutumnVN/ssassets/main/export/assets/assetbundles/icon/discskill/db_DiscSkill_6.webp","t":"Aumenta en ⟦0⟧ el daño Umbra del escuadrón.\nCuando un Trekker Versátil Umbra inflige daño de habilidad, el Trekker principal Umbra obtiene 1 acumulación de Resplandor de Flor durante ⟦1⟧ s, acumulándose hasta ⟦2⟧ veces. Al máximo de acumulaciones, aumenta en ⟦3⟧ el daño de habilidad infligido por los Trekkers Umbra del escuadrón.","v":[["5%","5","20","6%"],["6%","5","20","7.2%"],["7%","5","20","8.4%"],["8%","5","20","9.6%"],["9%","5","20","10.8%"],["10%","5","20","12%"]]},"arm":[{"n":"Armonía Umbral","ne":"Umbral Harmony","ic":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/AutumnVN/ssassets/main/export/assets/assetbundles/icon/discskill/DiscSkill_4.webp","bg":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/AutumnVN/ssassets/main/export/assets/assetbundles/icon/discskill/db_DiscSkill_6.webp","t":"Aumenta en ⟦0⟧ el daño de definitiva de los Trekkers Versátiles Umbra.\nResplandor de Flor obtiene un efecto adicional: cada acumulación aumenta en ⟦1⟧ el daño de habilidad y de definitiva propios.","v":[["6%","0.4%"],["12%","0.5%"],["18%","0.6%"],["24%","0.7%"],["30%","0.8%"]],"nt":[{"90023":10,"90016":10},{"90023":25,"90016":25},{"90023":40,"90016":40},{"90023":55,"90016":55},{"90023":70,"90016":70}],"pt":[120,240,360,480,600]},{"n":"Un Brindis Tras Bambalinas","ne":"A Toast Behind the Scenes","ic":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/AutumnVN/ssassets/main/export/assets/assetbundles/icon/discskill/DiscSkill_4.webp","bg":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/AutumnVN/ssassets/main/export/assets/assetbundles/icon/discskill/db_DiscSkill_6.webp","t":"Cuando el Trekker principal Umbra con el má